; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Inuktitut / ᐃᓄᒃᑎᑐᑦ (iu)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

ᓅᑎᕆᕗᖅ counter 5

launch_loop:
ᖃᕆᑕᐅᔭᐅᑉ_ᑐᒃᓯᕋᐅᑎᖓ counter
ᐃᓚᖔᖅᐹ counter 1
ᐊᔾᔨᒌᖕᓂᖏᑦ counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
ᓅᑎᕆᕗᖅ box 999
ᖃᕆᑕᐅᔭᐅᑉ_ᑐᒃᓯᕋᐅᑎᖓ box
